### [the long hall](hall)
---
Relic: ossuary
Box: 3600, 0, 2900, 900, 260, 380
---
A *built* space - flat walls and real corners, which no sphere can express. Half-extents,
so this is 1800 by 520 by 760.

### [the suspended core](core_solid)
---
Relic: ossuary
Solid: sphere, 32, 0, -39, 320
---
Subtracted from the hub: a mass hanging in the middle of the room you have to fly around.

### [the spine column](spine_solid)
